{
  "version": 1,
  "title": "Praxis at degree 3264 with two-leg base-coordinate packing",
  "claims": [
    "params.json is a parameter set of Praxis for the reference statement at 100-bit security whose ciphertext is 6740 MiB (6.5815 GiB) and whose time, one encryption plus one expected decryption, is 2314943 million field multiplications (20845 and 2294098), by the protected model, and every rule of the model as amended holds for it; proof.md proves that each amended entry (I3, Ncmp, I6, I4, n2, dec_msm_g1, dec_msm_g2, dec_pairings, n1, C6, C7, dec_sum_g2, H2) is sound, so that the paper's theorems hold for these parameters as rules.md requires."
  ],
  "experiments": [],
